Mock / Impersonation Application

Purpose:

- Validate whether created SSO connections are working properly.

Flow:

- Enter Group Customer Number + Employee ID + Portal.
- App generates SAML request.
- Sends request to MyBenefits portal.
- Simulates login experience for testing.

---

Technical Points

- Azure SQL used.
- ServiceNow integration implemented.
- JWT token reused due to ServiceNow token generation limits.
- Token expiry checked by decoding JWT.
- Entra token used for login.
- LDAP/RBAC-based access under development.
- PII data blurred by default for non-admin users.

